  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of the marks obtained by the students in a test are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> respectively. Later, the marks of one of the students is increased from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> . If the new mean of the marks is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. then their new variance is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
